y. Watch out, there's snakes on the ceiling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/3b0659f959fd529f671923544379ed6a.avif?t=1756999642\" width=560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.poster.avif?t=1756999642\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.webm?t=1756999642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/extras/a9c963d44f95006e681034c4a8989146.mp4?t=1756999642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gold you've mined to unlock nodes in a massive upgrade tree filled with new perks, different guns, gun cosmetics, and permanent upgrades.\u00a0Experiment, refine your playstyle, and unlock deeper layers of the cave, its systems are waiting to be mastered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Rogue Gecko"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894530/42108f37db20cd25882209e1a44c283d476867c9/header.jpg?t=1756999642","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or higher; SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>G